# Real resident data (names/DOB/phone/address) — stays local only, never
# committed. The actual data lives in the Google Sheet, not in git.
/sample
/people-import.csv
/scratch-*

# Raw source photos (already curated into web/public/images for the site;
# these loose working copies at the repo root don't need to be tracked).
/WhatsApp Image*.jpeg
/_O5A4*.jpg

# Any JSON file dropped at the repo root — no legitimate project file lives
# here as plain JSON, so this is almost always a downloaded Google Cloud
# service account credential (the private key that authenticates the
# website to the People sheet). The values that matter are already copied
# into web/.env.local; the JSON itself should not live in the repo at all
# (see README) and must never be committed.
/*.json

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
